  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Runs daily (business-day adjusted). Fetches orders due today with optimistic-locking version numbers, checks funds, then scores fraud risk via the same /fraud/score endpoint used by Transaction Execution before allowing execution \u2014 closing the v1.1 gap where a hijacked standing order ran unscored. Flagged executions are held via the Fraud Monitoring workflow instead of running. Insufficient-funds retries are unsupervised up to 3 attempts within 48 hours; the 3rd failure sends a permanent-failure notice. A version-guard conditional update prevents double-execution on concurrent edits."
  },
